    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/6840498dc368927ec59c48360dba3f9f.avif?t=1680196639\" /></span><br>Easy to play, very hard to finish. Can you beat <strong>The World's Hardest Game 3D World</strong>?<br><br><strong>The World's Hardest Game</strong>, which you used to play on flash game sites, is now with you in 3D. But this time there are 5 different worlds! Good luck!<br><br><strong>Challenge in different worlds, finish quests, upgrade your skills and reach the end in this 3D Hard Platformer.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/08704d32677107333f0059705e81cbbe.webp?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>5 Worlds with different weathers</strong><br></li><li><strong>Dynamic quest system</strong><br></li><li><strong>Skill upgrades</strong><br></li><li><strong>Cute graphics and colorful atmosphere</strong><br></li><li><strong>Different soundtracks for every World</strong><br></li><li><strong>Unique maps for every World</strong><br></li><li><strong>Leveling system</strong><br></li><li><strong>Various challenging obstacles</strong><br></li><li><strong>Long playing time</strong><br></li><li><strong>New worlds will be added with updates</strong><br></li><li><strong>Auto save system</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/095c82f3ad109dd4e3b033c134942fc8.webp?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/7374bd2b769f927ceaa11181688d2fdb.poster.avif?t=1680196639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/7374bd2b769f927ceaa11181688d2fdb.webm?t=1680196639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/7374bd2b769f927ceaa11181688d2fdb.mp4?t=1680196639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Dash to quickly dodge enemies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/d8af2ca57b9aa8a590c0ea985f3d05c8.webp?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/d3cf80a945abf36bc003349a63cba5d8.avif?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><strong>Some Worlds have unique maps, look at them, finish quests, earn experience, collect stars and hearts, upgrade your skills and reach to the end!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/51992268cf5fd5851bd2ce83a09cb18c.webp?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/85e274b6240b056603542c5106d4ae57.poster.avif?t=1680196639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/85e274b6240b056603542c5106d4ae57.webm?t=1680196639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/85e274b6240b056603542c5106d4ae57.mp4?t=1680196639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You can upgrade your skills with stars!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/c65ce134d6c43bea3cb61be0d43d6285.webp?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306040/extras/3fc3bfe20e4d2bf6c2a739e9adea2eb1.avif?t=1680196639\" /></span><br><strong>You can keep track of the quests you have taken and completed by looking at the journal.</strong>",
